Deep Code Review - Community System

📋 Project Overview

Project Name: Community (Incident Reporting System)  
Purpose: A Next.js-based web application for Marias Heights Community System to report incidents and track them with confidence.  
Tech Stack:
- Frontend: React 19, Next.js 15
- Styling: Tailwind CSS
- Animations: GSAP (GreenSock), Three.js (for 3D effects)
- Database: Supabase/Firebase (planned)
- Hosting: Vercel (planned)
- Email API: SendGrid (deadline: November 22)
- AI Model: Gemini Flash (planned)

