---

 📦 Component Deep Dive

1. Beams.jsx (3D Background Animation)
Purpose: Creates an animated 3D beam effect using Three.js and React Three Fiber.

Key Features:
- Uses WebGL shaders for performance
- Custom noise function for organic movement
- Configurable parameters (beamWidth, beamHeight, beamNumber, speed, etc.)
- Creates a sophisticated animated background

Technical Details:
- Uses `@react-three/fiber` for React integration with Three.js
- Implements custom shader materials extending Three.js MeshStandardMaterial
- Uses 3D noise functions for beam distortion
- Renders multiple stacked planes as beams

Code Quality: 
- Well-structured but complex
- Good use of React hooks (useMemo, useRef)
- Proper cleanup in useEffect

Issues Found:
- ⚠️ ESLint disabled for React Three Fiber props (`react/no-unknown-property`)
- ⚠️ No error boundaries for WebGL failures
- ⚠️ High memory usage with many beams (30 beams × 100 segments)

---

2. LoginCard.jsx (Login Form)
Purpose: User authentication login form.

Features:
- Email/password input
- "Remember me" checkbox
- Password visibility toggle (eye icon)
- "Forgot Password?" link (non-functional)
- Google OAuth button (non-functional)
- Link to registration page

State Management:
```javascript
- email: string
- password: string
- remember: boolean
- showPassword: boolean
```

Code Quality: ⭐⭐⭐ (3/5)

Issues Found:
- ❌ CRITICAL: Form submission is prevented but no actual authentication logic
- ❌ No form validation (email format, password strength)
- ❌ No loading states
- ❌ No error handling
- ❌ "Forgot Password?" button doesn't navigate anywhere
- ❌ Google OAuth button is not connected
- ⚠️ Inconsistent spacing (mt-[100px] in RegistrationCard but not here)
- ⚠️ Hardcoded container dimensions (w-[515px] h-[550px])

Missing Functionality:
- Form validation
- API integration
- Loading states
- Error messages
- Session management

---

3. RegistrationCard.jsx (Registration Form)
Purpose: New user registration form.

Features:
- First name / Last name fields
- Email input
- Password and confirm password
- Terms & conditions checkbox
- Google OAuth signup (non-functional)
- Link back to login

State Management:
```javascript
- firstName: string
- lastName: string
- email: string
- password: string
- confirmPassword: string
- agreeToTerms: boolean
```

Code Quality: ⭐⭐⭐ (3/5)

Issues Found:
- ❌ CRITICAL: No password matching validation
- ❌ No form validation whatsoever
- ❌ No email format validation
- ❌ No password strength requirements
- ❌ Terms checkbox not enforced before submission
- ❌ Massive spacing issue: `mt-[100px]` on email, password, and confirm password fields (line 58, 87, 104) - this will cause huge gaps!
- ❌ No API integration
- ❌ No loading states
- ⚠️ Hardcoded container dimensions (w-[600px] h-[800px])

Design Issues:
- The `mt-[100px]` classes create 100px margins between fields, making the form extremely tall and poorly spaced

---

 4. Header.jsx (Landing Page Header)
