 `/register` (app/register/page.jsx) - Registration Page
- Current State: Registration form with Beams background
- Components Used: Beams, RegistrationCard
- Status: ✅ Functional UI, ❌ No backend, ❌ Spacing issues

 `/landingpage` (app/landingpage/page.jsx) - Marketing Page
- Current State: Landing page with Header, DidYouKnow, WhyCommunitySystem, FAQ, Footer
- Components Used: Header, DidYouKnow, WhyCommunitySystem, FAQ, Footer
- Status: ✅ Basic structure, ⚠️ Needs content enhancement
- Note: This route exists but may not be the main entry point

---

 🐛 Critical Issues

 1. No Backend Integration
- ❌ No API routes defined
- ❌ No authentication logic
- ❌ No database connection
- ❌ Forms submit to nowhere

 2. Form Validation Missing
- ❌ No email format validation
- ❌ No password strength requirements
- ❌ No password matching check (RegistrationCard)
- ❌ No required field validation

 3. Spacing Bug in RegistrationCard
- ❌ `mt-[100px]` on multiple fields creates excessive spacing
- This makes the form unusable on most screens

 4. Missing Error Handling
- ❌ No try-catch blocks
- ❌ No error states
- ❌ No user feedback for errors

 5. No Loading States
- ❌ No loading indicators
- ❌ No disabled states during submission
- ❌ No async handling

 6. Incomplete Features
- ❌ "Forgot Password?" doesn't work
- ❌ Google OAuth buttons are placeholders
- ❌ Terms & Privacy links don't exist

---

 ⚠️ Code Quality Issues

 1. Inconsistent Patterns
- Mix of functional components and arrow functions
- Some components use `export default`, others don't
- Inconsistent prop naming

 2. Hardcoded Values
- Container dimensions hardcoded (w-[515px], h-[550px])
- Magic numbers in Beams component
- Hardcoded colors instead of theme variables

 3. Missing TypeScript
- All files are `.jsx` - no type safety
- Props are not validated
- No IntelliSense support

 4. Accessibility Issues
- ❌ Missing ARIA labels
- ❌ No keyboard navigation hints
- ❌ Color contrast may be insufficient
- ❌ No focus indicators on some interactive elements

 5. Performance Concerns
- ⚠️ Beams component is heavy (30 beams × 100 segments)
- ⚠️ No code splitting
- ⚠️ Large bundle size with Three.js

 6. Security Concerns
- ❌ No CSRF protection
- ❌ No input sanitization
- ❌ Password fields don't enforce policies
- ❌ No rate limiting (when backend is added)

