 🎨 Design & UX Issues

 1. Responsive Design
- ⚠️ Fixed widths on forms (515px, 600px) may not work on mobile
- ⚠️ Beams component may be too heavy for mobile devices

 2. User Experience
- ❌ No feedback on form submission
- ❌ No success messages
- ❌ No loading indicators
- ❌ Forms feel "dead" (no interaction feedback)

 3. Visual Consistency
- ⚠️ Some components use different spacing patterns
- ⚠️ Color scheme is consistent (orange/white) but could be more refined

