5. Routing: Proper Next.js App Router setup
6. Styling: Consistent use of Tailwind CSS

---

 🚀 Recommendations

 Immediate Fixes (Priority 1)
1. Fix RegistrationCard spacing - Remove `mt-[100px]` classes
2. Add form validation - Use a library like `react-hook-form` + `zod`
3. Create API routes - Set up Next.js API routes for auth
4. Add loading states - Show spinners during form submission
5. Add error handling - Display user-friendly error messages

 Short-term (Priority 2)
1. Implement authentication - Connect to Supabase/Firebase
2. Add password validation - Strength requirements + matching
3. Create Terms & Privacy pages - Or link to external docs
4. Implement "Forgot Password" - Email reset flow
5. Add session management - Cookies/JWT handling

 Long-term (Priority 3)
1. Add TypeScript - Convert to `.tsx` for type safety
2. Optimize Beams component - Reduce beam count on mobile
3. Enhance landing page - More content, better animations
4. Add tests - Unit tests for components
5. Implement Google OAuth - Connect to actual OAuth provider
6. Add analytics - Track user behavior
7. Improve accessibility - ARIA labels, keyboard nav

